; Rosetta - Threading tab's Return to Start.
; Called from MDI by Rosetta_main.py's Thread_Return - not meant to be run by hand.
; Created 24 September 2026
;
; Pulls the cutter straight out along X first, so it clears the thread,
; then moves Z and C back together.
;
; #1 X move, #2 Z move, #3 C move (degrees) - all incremental
; #4 units - 20 inch, 21 mm

o<rosetta_thread_return> sub
  o100 if [#4 EQ 21]
    G21
  o100 else
    G20
  o100 endif
  G8 G91 G94
  G0 X#1
  G0 Z#2 C#3
o<rosetta_thread_return> endsub
M2
